---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Comunidad — Town OS" lang="es-MX">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container community-container">
      <h1>Comunidad</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">
        Conéctate con la comunidad de Town OS. Únete para hacer preguntas, compartir ideas y estar al día.
      </p>

      <div class="community-links">
        <a href="https://youtube.com/@scarlettschool" class="community-card community-card--highlight" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 00-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 00.502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 002.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 002.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h2>YouTube</h2>
            <p>Mira videos sobre el proyecto Town OS en Scarlett School.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/town-os.bsky.social" class="community-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 10.8c-1.087-2.114-4.046-6.053-6.798-7.995C2.566.944 1.561 1.266.902 1.565.139 1.908 0 3.08 0 3.768c0 .69.378 5.65.6 6.463.764 2.8 3.508 3.527 5.944 3.285-4.258.423-8.012 2.127-3.128 7.485 5.107 4.747 7.333-1.2 8.584-5.46.225.755.676 2.625 1.24 3.867.827 1.823 1.87 2.695 3.344 1.593 1.25-1.036 3.16-2.688 3.832-3.591 1.076-1.273 1.084-2.6.456-3.82-1.238-2.404-3.484-2.64-5.328-2.59 2.436.243 5.18-.484 5.944-3.284C21.622 9.418 22 4.458 22 3.768c0-.69-.139-1.861-.902-2.203-.659-.3-1.664-.62-4.3 1.24C14.046 4.747 11.087 8.686 12 10.8z" transform="translate(1 1)"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h2>Bluesky</h2>
            <p>Sigue a @town-os.bsky.social para novedades y anuncios del proyecto.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://mastodon.social/@townos" class="community-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M23.268 5.313c-.35-2.578-2.617-4.61-5.304-5.004C17.51.242 15.792 0 11.813 0h-.03c-3.98 0-4.835.242-5.288.309C3.882.692 1.496 2.518.917 5.127.64 6.412.61 7.837.661 9.143c.073 1.874.088 3.745.26 5.611.118 1.24.325 2.47.62 3.68.55 2.237 2.777 4.098 4.96 4.857 2.336.792 4.849.923 7.256.38.265-.061.527-.132.786-.213.585-.184 1.27-.39 1.774-.753a.057.057 0 0 0 .023-.043v-1.809a.052.052 0 0 0-.02-.041.053.053 0 0 0-.046-.01 20.282 20.282 0 0 1-4.709.545c-2.73 0-3.463-1.284-3.674-1.818a5.593 5.593 0 0 1-.319-1.433.053.053 0 0 1 .066-.054c1.517.363 3.072.546 4.632.546.376 0 .75 0 1.125-.01 1.57-.044 3.224-.124 4.768-.422.038-.008.077-.015.11-.024 2.435-.464 4.753-1.92 4.989-5.604.008-.145.03-1.52.03-1.67.002-.512.167-3.63-.024-5.545zm-3.748 9.195h-2.561V8.29c0-1.309-.55-1.976-1.67-1.976-1.23 0-1.846.79-1.846 2.35v3.403h-2.546V8.663c0-1.56-.617-2.35-1.848-2.35-1.112 0-1.668.668-1.67 1.977v6.218H4.822V8.102c0-1.31.337-2.35 1.011-3.12.696-.77 1.608-1.164 2.74-1.164 1.311 0 2.302.5 2.962 1.498l.638 1.06.638-1.06c.66-.999 1.65-1.498 2.96-1.498 1.13 0 2.043.395 2.74 1.164.675.77 1.012 1.81 1.012 3.12z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h2>Mastodon</h2>
            <p>Espejo de las publicaciones de Bluesky. Sigue a @townos@mastodon.social para recibir las mismas novedades en el fediverso.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://gitea.com/town-os/town-os/issues" class="community-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="40" height="40" fill="currentColor">
              <path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm1 15h-2v-2h2v2zm0-4h-2V7h2v6z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="card-content">
            <h2>Reportar un error</h2>
            <p>Junta los registros, resume los errores y abre un issue en Gitea.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="card-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="community-note">
        <h2>Tutorías en Berkeley</h2>
        <p>
          Erik Hollensbe ofrece tutorías a la comunidad local de Berkeley, tanto de desarrollo de
          sistemas como de uso de la IA. Lo puedes encontrar en las cafeterías de la ciudad, o
          ayudando a los residentes de la comunidad sin hogar de Berkeley cerca de Telegraph y Durant.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .community-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .community-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .community-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .community-card--highlight {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 6%, var(--color-bg-card));
  }

  .community-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .community-card--highlight:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .card-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .card-content {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .card-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .card-content p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .card-arrow {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }

  .community-card:hover .card-arrow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .community-note {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 640px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .community-note h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .community-note p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .community-card {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .community-note {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
